{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "summary": "Diagnosed and minimally fixed the four planted orrery regressions in room/src/orrery.js, each with a red-green test in tests/regression/bugs.test.mjs. B1: makeColor applied the sRGB encode twice (background and plaque too bright and washed out). B2: camera.near set to 0.0002 and the floor decal's polygon offset disabled, so the decal z-fought with the floor. B5: tick advanced time by a fixed 16.667 ms per frame instead of the host clock. B7: the next-planet and resize listeners were never removed on unmount, so they stacked across remounts.",
